<title>SINGAPORE: Jaya announces S$50 mln fleet expansion.</title>
<headline>Jaya announces S$50 mln fleet expansion.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jaya Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had embarked on a Singapore $50 million new-building programme to expand its fleet.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement six offshore vessels and one 6,200-dwt cargo vessel were already under construction. These comprised two 29-metre towing tugs, two landing craft and two 230-ft barges.</p>
<p>It said it intended to award contracts for the construction of a further eight vessels in the coming months, including tugs, supply vessels and a barge.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
